# The same keys while an input method is composing.
#
# Nothing goes to the child until the composition ends. What the user can see
# meanwhile is the app's own overlay, not the terminal's screen — a half-made
# syllable in the grid could not be taken back.

# A prompt to type at, so the screen the golden holds is one a terminal
# would really be showing when the keys below arrive.
out "$ "

key A "a"
key A composing "a"
key Enter
key Enter composing
